@startuml
!include theme.puml
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "Mock sumber" as source
participant "Poller" as poll
participant "Reader dan mapper" as map
database "PostgreSQL" as db
poll -> db : baca checkpoint endpoint
poll -> source : GET since=watermark-overlap\ncorrelation ID dan kredensial sumber
source --> poll : array JSON (field tambahan boleh ada)
poll -> map : decode field wajib dan Extra
map --> poll : record valid atau alasan karantina
loop Setiap record
alt Record valid dan envelope dalam batas
poll -> db : transaksi record\nkorelasi, hash, hazard dan outbox
db --> poll : COMMIT
else Record invalid atau envelope terlalu besar
poll -> db : rollback bila perlu\nlalu transaksi karantina
db --> poll : COMMIT karantina
end
end
poll -> db : simpan checkpoint setelah seluruh respons selesai
poll -> db : catat status hasil polling
note over source,poll
HTTP gagal: checkpoint tidak maju.
DB gagal: checkpoint tidak maju; prefix tersimpan.
Field aditif valid: attributes JSONB, tanpa DDL.
end note
@enduml
